command showed connection refused, proving the node went down."},{"requirement":"node1 changed boot identity proving actual restart","command_ids":["cmd-006c7a7019134bd9"],"summary":"Polled until node1 became reachable again; boot_id read as 39510b7f-5faf-498a-a522-628f41f3f943, differing from the pre-restart value, and uptime -s showed a new boot time (09:15:00 vs 09:14:07)."},{"requirement":"node1 post-restart service/data recovery","command_ids":["cmd-18c58bf8f1924242"],"summary":"After restart, inventory-worker.service reported active/enabled and the running process (new PID 837) was confirmed via ps to be owned by inventorysvc, showing the service auto-started under the correct account after reboot."}]},"ttft_ms":1405,"type":"result","duration_ms":52932,"uuid":"b7a59d76-bd27-45f5-8c09-59d5cd4e7698","ttft_stream_ms":837,"time_to_request_ms":46,"queued_turn_count":0}
